  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help us care for cats on Gili islands, Indonesia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cats Of Gili project have supported the infamous cat population living on the Gili islands, Indonesia since 2013.  We look after kittens and any sick or injured cats brought to us. We also organise big and free spay/neuter clinics a few times a year to help keep the cat population healthy and under control. In times of crisis (such as Lombok earthquakes in 2018, and Covid pandemic stopping tourism totally) we step in to keep our island cats well fed and looked after.</narrative>
  </description>
